<title>ITALY: SOCCER-AC MILAN BEAT CHELSEA IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AC MILAN BEAT CHELSEA IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's AC Milan beat Chelsea of England 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Christophe Dugarry (9, 62).</p>
</text>
